ink text-black font-semibold text-sm" aria-current="false">Codes</a></div></li><li class="pl-6"><a href="/docs/developer-resources/ip-addresses" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer inline link-text text-black-secondary text-sm font-semibold hover:no-underline" data-nav-url="/developer-resources/ip-addresses" aria-current="page"><mark class="bg-transparent box-border border-b-2 border-blue-100 color-[inherit] font-[inherit] text-blue-100 font-semibold">IP addresses</mark></a></li></ul></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex gap-2"><button class="ga-nav-icon h-6 w-4 transition-transform" aria-label="open Funds management submenu" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 8 16" focusable="false" class="h-4 w-4 [&amp;&gt;*]:stroke-grey-500"><path stroke="currentColor" d="M1 12.998 7 7 1 1.002"></path></svg></button><a href="/docs/funds-management" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer inline hover:underline link-text ga-nav-link text-black font-semibold text-md" aria-current="false">Funds management</a></div></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex gap-2"><button class="ga-nav-icon h-6 w-4 transition-transform" aria-label="open Business operations submenu" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 8 16" focusable="false" class="h-4 w-4 [&amp;&gt;*]:stroke-grey-500"><path stroke="currentColor" d="M1 12.998 7 7 1 1.002"></path></svg></button><a href="/docs/business-operations" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer inline hover:underline link-text ga-nav-link text-black font-semibold text-md" aria-current="false">Business operations</a></div></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex gap-2"><button class="ga-nav-icon h-6 w-4 transition-transform" aria-label="open Card issuing submenu" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 8 16" focusable="false" class="h-4 w-4 [&amp;&gt;*]:stroke-grey-500"><path stroke="currentColor" d="M1 12.998 7 7 1 1.002"></path></svg></button><a href="/docs/card-issuing" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer inline hover:underline link-text ga-nav-link text-black font-semibold text-md" aria-current="false">Card issuing</a></div></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex gap-2"><button class="ga-nav-icon h-6 w-4 transition-transform" aria-label="open Platforms submenu" aria-expanded="false" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 8 16" focusable="false" class="h-4 w-4 [&amp;&gt;*]:stroke-grey-500"><path stroke="currentColor" d="M1 12.998 7 7 1 1.002"></path></svg></button><a href="/docs/platforms" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer inline hover:underline link-text ga-nav-link text-black font-semibold text-md" aria-current="false">Platforms</a></div></li></ul></div></div><main id="main" class="relative flex mx-auto w-full lg:w-full md:pb-16 max-w-[1232px] pt-6 pb-24 px-6 lg:px-0"><div class="w-full pl-0 lg:pl-8 xl:px-16"><header class="mb-8 grid gap-4"><div class="grid gap-8"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 text-sm leading-4"><li><a href="/docs/developer-resources" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer inline hover:underline link-text text-sm leading-4 font-light text-black-secondary" id="ga-breadcrumb">Developer resources</a></li><span class="select-none" aria-hidden="true">/</span><li><a href="/docs/developer-resources/ip-addresses" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer inline hover:underline link-text text-sm leading-4 font-medium text-black" aria-current="page" id="ga-breadcrumb">IP addresses</a></li></ol></nav><h1 class="flex items-center gap-4 font-semibold text-black max-[376px]:text-[32px] max-[376px]:leading-10 text-[40px] leading-[48px]">IP addresses</h1></div><p class="text-sm font-light leading-4 text-black">Last updated: <!-- -->February 15, 2023</p></header><div class="w-full xl:max-w-[864px]"><p class="text-base font-normal normal-case text-black mb-8 [&amp;:has(.arrow-link)]:mb-0">For your integration to work properly, you must ensure it can reach the IP addresses of Checkout.com&#x27;s API. If your integration receives webhook notifications from us, make sure it also allows requests from Checkout.com’s webhook servers.</p><p class="text-base font-normal normal-case text-black mb-8 [&amp;:has(.arrow-link)]:mb-0">You can <a href="/docs/developer-resources/ip-addresses#Retrieve_IP_address-lists" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer font-medium text-md inline hover:underline link-text text-blue-100">retrieve the lists</a> and update your allowlists programmatically.</p><div class="relative grid gap-6 p-6 rounded-lg text-black w-full bg-yellow-400 mb-10"><div class="flex gap-4 items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" class="inline-block shrink-0 w-6 h-6"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12.1 18.1c-.3.2-.7 0-.9-.1l-.1-.3-.1-.3v-.3l.2-.3.6-.2h.3l.3.2.1.3.1.3v.3l-.2.3zm.5-3.9a.8.8 0 0 1-1.6 0V7.8a.8.8 0 0 1 1.6 0z"></path><path stroke="currentColor" d="M14.2 2.8a2.5 2.5 0 0 0-4.4 0L1.3 17.4c-1 1.7.2 3.8 2.2 3.8h17c2 0 3.2-2.1 2.2-3.8L14.2 2.7z"></path></svg><h3 class="text-lg leading-6 font-semibold">Note</h3></div><div class="[&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0"><p class="text-base font-normal normal-case text-black mb-8 [&amp;:has(.arrow-link)]:mb-0">The provided IP address lists are subject to change. We&#x27;ll let you know before this happens.</p><p class="text-base font-normal normal-case text-black mb-8 [&amp;:has(.arrow-link)]:mb-0">You may experience access issues if you do not keep your allowlists updated.</p></div></div><button aria-label="Copy section link to clipboard" type="button" class="mb-4 group flex items-center gap-2"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-4 font-semibold text-black text-xl">Retrieve IP address lists</h2><svg class="opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><g fill="var(--base-icon-primary-alt, var(--base-icon-primary, #141414))"><g><path d="M8.15,7.15a.48.48,0,0,0,0,.7,2.35,2.35,0,0,1,0,3.3l-2,2a2.33,2.33,0,0,1-3.3-3.3l2-2a2.35,2.35,0,0,1,.47-.36.5.5,0,0,0,.17-.68.49.49,0,0,0-.68-.18,3,3,0,0,0-.66.52l-2,2a3.32,3.32,0,1,0,4.7,4.7l2-2a3.32,3.32,0,0,0,0-4.7A.48.48,0,0,0,8.15,7.15Z"></path><path d="M13.85,2.15a3.32,3.32,0,0,0-4.7,0l-2,2a3.32,3.32,0,0,0,0,4.7.49.49,0,0,0,.7-.7,2.35,2.35,0,0,1,0-3.3l2-2a2.33,2.33,0,0,1,3.3,3.3l-2,2a2.35,2.35,0,0,1-.47.36.5.5,0,0,0,.26.93.59.59,0,0,0,.25-.07,3.29,3.29,0,0,0,.66-.52l2-2A3.32,3.32,0,0,0,13.85,2.15Z"></path></g></g></svg></button><div class="relative"><span class="anchor-nav-item absolute -top-[200px]" data-content="RetrieveIPaddresslists" id="Retrieve_IP_address_lists"></span></div><p class="text-base font-normal normal-case text-black mb-8 [&amp;:has(.arrow-link)]:mb-0">You can retrieve the IP address lists in machine-readable format from the following endpoints.</p><p class="text-base font-normal normal-case text-black mb-8 [&amp;:has(.arrow-link)]:mb-0">Production environment:</p><ul class="list-disc [padding-inline-start:24px] mb-8"><li class="[&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0"><a href="/docs/files/ip-lists/api-live.txt" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer font-medium text-md inline hover:underline link-text text-blue-100">https://checkout.com/docs/public/files/ip-lists/api-live.txt</a></li><li class="[&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0"><a href="/docs/files/ip-lists/webhooks-live.txt" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer font-medium text-md inline hover:underline link-text text-blue-100">https://checkout.com/docs/public/files/ip-lists/webhooks-live.txt</a></li></ul><p class="text-base font-normal normal-case text-black mb-8 [&amp;:has(.arrow-link)]:mb-0">Sandbox environment:</p><ul class="list-disc [padding-inline-start:24px] mb-8"><li class="[&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0"><a href="/docs/files/ip-lists/api-sandbox.txt" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer font-medium text-md inline hover:underline link-text text-blue-100">https://checkout.com/docs/public/files/ip-lists/api-sandbox.txt</a></li><li class="[&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0"><a href="/docs/files/ip-lists/webhooks-sandbox.txt" target="" class="cursor:pointer items-center gap-2.5 group group no-underline cursor-pointer font-medium text-md inline hover:underline link-text text-blue-100">https://checkout.com/docs/public/files/ip-lists/webhooks-sandbox.txt</a></li></ul><p class="text-base font-normal normal-case text-black mb-8 [&amp;:has(.arrow-link)]:mb-0">Each file contains a list of IP addresses and CIDR blocks, with one address or block displayed per line.</p><button aria-label="Copy section link to clipboard" type="button" class="mb-4 group flex items-center gap-2"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-4 font-semibold text-black text-xl">Send requests to Checkout.com&#x27;s API</h2><svg class="opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><g fill="var(--base-icon-primary-alt, var(--base-icon-primary, #141414))"><g><path d="M8.15,7.15a.48.48,0,0,0,0,.7,2.35,2.35,0,0,1,0,3.3l-2,2a2.33,2.33,0,0,1-3.3-3.3l2-2a2.35,2.35,0,0,1,.47-.36.5.5,0,0,0,.17-.68.49.49,0,0,0-.68-.18,3,3,0,0,0-.66.52l-2,2a3.32,3.32,0,1,0,4.7,4.7l2-2a3.32,3.32,0,0,0,0-4.7A.48.48,0,0,0,8.15,7.15Z"></path><path d="M13.85,2.15a3.32,3.32,0,0,0-4.7,0l-2,2a3.32,3.32,0,0,0,0,4.7.49.49,0,0,0,.7-.7,2.35,2.35,0,0,1,0-3.3l2-2a2.33,2.33,0,0,1,3.3,3.3l-2,2a2.35,2.35,0,0,1-.47.36.5.5,0,0,0,.26.93.59.59,0,0,0,.25-.07,3.29,3.29,0,0,0,.66-.52l2-2A3.32,3.32,0,0,0,13.85,2.15Z"></path></g></g></svg></button><div class="relative"><span class="anchor-nav-item absolute -top-[200px]" data-content="SendrequeststoCheckoutcomsAPI" id="Send_requests_to_Checkout.com&#x27;s_API"></span></div><p class="text-base font-normal normal-case text-black mb-8 [&amp;:has(.arrow-link)]:mb-0">Your integration will send requests to specific IP addresses, depending on whether you&#x27;re in a live or sandbox environment.</p><button type="button" aria-hidden="true" style="position:fixed;top:1px;left:1px;width:1px;height:0;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;border-width:0"></button><div class=""><div class="w-full border-b border-grey-100" role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal"></div><div class="pt-4"><div class="" aria-hidden="false" id="headlessui-tabs-panel-:R5kqtlan6:" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-headlessui-state="selected"><ul class="list-disc [padding-inline-start:24px] mb-8"><li class="[&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0"><code class="py-[2px] px-2 rounded text-grey-800 bg-grey-100 font-code text-sm font-normal break-words">52.214.237.28</code></li><li class="[&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0"><code class="py-[2px] px-2 rounded text-grey-800 bg-grey-100 font-code text-sm font-normal break-words">63.33.82.13</code></li><li class="[&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0"><code class="py-[2px] px-2 rounded text-grey-800 bg-grey-100 font-code text-sm font-normal break-words">54.154.129.37</code></li><li class="[&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0"><code class="py-[2px] px-2 rounded text-grey-800 bg-grey-100 font-code text-sm font-normal break-words">52.212.208.92</code></li><li class="[&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0"><code class="py-[2px] px-2 rounded text-grey-800 bg-grey-100 font-code text-sm font-normal break-words">34.240.204.145</code></li><li class="[&amp